<title>TURKEY: Turkish foreign debt up to $79.8 bln at end-1996.</title>
<headline>Turkish foreign debt up to $79.8 bln at end-1996.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's foreign debt stock at end-1996 went up to $79.767 billion from $73.278 a year earlier, the treasury said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It said $59.231 billion of the total was medium- and long-term debts and the remaining short-term debts in 1996.</p>
</text>
